Herdr logo

Herdr logo © Herdr contributors, licensed under Apache-2.0. Modified for visibility.

Original:
  https://github.com/herdrdev/herdr/blob/v0.8.0/assets/logo.png

This repository uses a derivative of that image only as a visual
indicator while Herdr mode is active. It is not a brand logo for
herdr-mode itself.

Modifications:
  Recolored for contrast against dark terminal backgrounds.
  Scaled via kitty window_logo_scale so the visible size stays small
  even with transparent padding in the source image.
